      <ul><li><a href="https://india.mongabay.com/2026/11/el-nino-link-offers-early-warning-of-humid-heat/" rel="noopener">Mongabay India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
