     <article class="story single" data-beat="finance">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">FINANCE</span> · Livemint Money · 2026-11-04 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Gold and Silver Prices Rise in Coimbatore and Major Indian Cities Ahead of Diwali 2026</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#finance</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Gold prices in Coimbatore and major Indian cities rose on Wednesday, November 4, 2026, driven by global market trends as markets awaited US midterm election results and non-farm payroll data. Spot gold increased 0.5% to $3,947.49 per ounce, while domestic gold futures on the Multi Commodity Exchange rose by ₹510 to ₹1,39,962 per 10 grams.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-04/gold-and-silver-prices-rise-in-coimbatore-and-major-indian-c.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Retail prices varied across cities such as Mumbai, Delhi, and Coimbatore for 18K, 22K, and 24K gold alongside 999 Fine silver ahead of Dhanteras and Diwali 2026. In Coimbatore, 24-karat gold reached ₹1,42,880 per 10 grams, 22-karat hit ₹1,30,973, and 18-karat was priced at ₹1,07,160, while Silver 999 Fine stood at ₹1,87,040 per kg.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Solid coverage of gold and silver pricing details, aligning well with the source text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/gold-rate-today-coimbatore-nov-4-wednesday-up-down-latest-price-investors-dhanteras-diwali-2026-isha-city-silver-prices-11793771174098.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/coimbatore/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Coimbatore</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
