     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-11-04 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Vande Bharat Sleeper Design Feature Highlights Layout Differences From Rajdhani</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Travel content creator Dhananjay Kumar has highlighted a key design feature in the Vande Bharat Sleeper that aims to reduce disturbances during overnight journeys. By incorporating a sliding door near the entrance and additional space between the gate and passenger berths, the layout keeps sleeping areas away from the constant movement of passengers and vendors. This marks a notable difference from conventional AC 3-tier coaches on trains like the Rajdhani Express, where passengers near the entrance often experience disruptions. Social media users have widely praised the practical layout improvement.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-04/vande-bharat-sleeper-design-feature-highlights-layout-differ.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Concise and well-targeted summary of the Vande Bharat Sleeper design feature highlighted by the vlogger.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/cities/mumbai-news/vande-bharat-sleeper-vs-rajdhani-a-small-detail-in-the-new-train-is-winning-attention-watch-cx-amz-ws-l-10412021.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
